      rule: "Stop, remember, forget — ikkala shaklni (V-ing va to V1) qabul qiladi, lekin ma'no BUTUNLAY O'ZGARADI!\n\n📌 STOP:\n  Stop + V-ing = biror ishni to'xtatish (qilishni bas qilish)\n    I stopped smoking. (Men chekishni tashladim — chekmayman)\n  Stop + to V1 = biror ishni qilish uchun to'xtash\n    I stopped to smoke. (Men chekish uchun to'xtadim — chekdim va davom etdim)\n\n📌 REMEMBER:\n  Remember + V-ing = oldin qilgan ishni eslash\n    I remember locking the door. (Eshikni berkitganimni eslayman)\n  Remember + to V1 = qilishi kerak bo'lgan ishni eslash\n    I remembered to lock the door. (Eshikni berkitishni esladim)\n\n📌 FORGET:\n  Forget + V-ing = oldin qilgan ishni unutish (ko'pincha never bilan)\n    I will never forget meeting her. (U bilan uchrashganimni hech qachon unutmayman)\n  Forget + to V1 = qilishi kerak bo'lgan ishni unutish\n    I forgot to lock the door. (Eshikni berkitishni unutdim)",
      mnemonic: "STOP + V-ing = bas qilish. STOP + to V1 = to'xtab, keyin qilish.\nREMEMBER + V-ing = o'tmishni eslash. REMEMBER + to V1 = kelajakni eslash.\nFORGET + V-ing = o'tmishni unutish (never bilan). FORGET + to V1 = qilishni unutish.",
